{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor’s first turn (event lite_evt_00031) omitted acute stroke/bleeding red-flag screening and gave generic reassurance, causing a serious in-chain error under RC1. Although later turns partially recovered medication safety and repeated the prohibition on self-adjusting antithrombotics, that initial safety failure cannot be erased. No complete high-order capability was achieved, so the maximum possible grade is 2.",
